        {
          "text": "Futhi zithathele izinongo eziphambili, amashekeli angamakhulu ayisihlanu emure elicwengekileyo, nesinamoni elimnandi ingxenye yalo, amashekeli angamakhulu amabili namashumi ayisihlanu, nekhalamu elimnandi amashekeli angamakhulu amabili namashumi ayisihlanu;",
